---
<section id="story">
  <div class="story">
    <div class="story__grid">
      <div class="story__photo-wrap">
        <div class="story__photo" role="img" aria-label="Cozy living room with fireplace in a Kendrick Realty represented home"></div>
        <div class="story__badge">
          <div class="story__badge-year">Est. 2016</div>
          <div class="story__badge-line">Independently owned, deliberately boutique.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="story__text">
        <div class="kr-eyebrow">Our story</div>
        <h2>A brokerage built on one simple truth</h2>
        <p>
          Kendrick Realty began with a belief that buying or selling a home should feel personal — never
          transactional. We stayed small on purpose, so that every client works directly with someone who
          knows their name, their goals, and their timeline.
        </p>
        <p>
          That focus is what lets us be a genuine guide. We've walked the path enough times to anticipate
          the next turn, smooth the rough patches, and keep you confident from the first conversation to the
          keys in your hand.
        </p>
        <div class="story__bullets">
          <div class="story__bullet">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
            </svg>
            Bay Area · Sacramento · Central Valley
          </div>
          <div class="story__bullet">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
            Discreet, full-service representation
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="approach">
  <div class="approach">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="kr-eyebrow">How we work</div>
      <h2>The calm in the middle of a big decision</h2>
      <p>Buying or selling a home is rarely just a transaction — it's a chapter of your life. Our role is to make it feel considered, unhurried, and entirely in good hands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="approach__cards">
      <div class="kr-card kr-hover approach-card">
        <div class="approach-card__icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>A fluent guide</h3>
        <p>We know every turn of the process by heart, so you never feel lost. We translate the paperwork, the timelines, and the decisions into plain language — and stay a step ahead for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kr-card kr-hover approach-card">
        <div class="approach-card__icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Comfort at every price point</h3>
        <p>First home or fifth, three hundred thousand or several million — the care, attention, and discretion are exactly the same. You are never just a transaction here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kr-card kr-hover approach-card">
        <div class="approach-card__icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <polygon points="6 3 18 3 22 9 12 22 2 9 6 3"/><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="9"/><polyline points="2 9 12 9 22 9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>A boutique experience</h3>
        <p>Small by design. You work with people who know your name, answer their own phone, and treat your move as if it were their own.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
